{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15934","headline":"坏屋 · 王建","name":"坏屋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"官家有坏屋，居者愿离得。\n苟或幸其迁，回循任倾侧。\n若当君子住，一日还修餙。\n必使换榱楹，先须木端直。\n永令雀与鼠，无处求栖息。\n坚固传後人，从今勉劳力。\n以兹喩臣下，亦可成邦国。\n虽曰愚者词，将来幸无惑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15934.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15934","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}